    evtF asegs RNG POST (ZS 0x8994c mm y1 x5 y6 x7 x8 (Z_to_bv 64 B) y10 (Z_to_bv 64 flag) x12 y13 (Z_to_bv 64 nb) y15
                            (Z_to_bv 64 64) x17 y18 y19 y14 (Z_to_bv 64 p) y22 (Z_to_bv 64 (SS + O))
                            (Z_to_bv 64 (tl + 256 * mtl)) (Z_to_bv 64 (DST + Qe)) (Z_to_bv 64 (SS + O + pt))
                            (Z_to_bv 64 2147450880) (Z_to_bv 64 (DST + Qe - 9)) (Z_to_bv 64 (64 - tl)) x30 x31).
